# 5 Quality Gates

- **Gate 1:** Blast Radius Discovery (Direct, Indirect, Operational).
- **Gate 2:** Microservice Boundaries & Distributed Resilience (Outbox, Idempotency, Timeouts).
- **Gate 3:** Database Architecture & Concurrency (Zero N+1, Index order, Short TXs, Pessimistic/Optimistic locks).
- **Gate 4:** Atomic Bottom-Up Execution (Entities -> Repos -> Services -> Controllers -> Tests).
- **Gate 5:** Adversarial Self-Review (Reflexion loop, >=98% confidence).